  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あいての　あしもとに　どくびしを\nしかける。　こうたいで　でてきた　あいての\nポケモンに　どくを　おわせる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대의 발밑에 독 압정을\n뿌린다. 교체로 나온 상대\n포켓몬에게 독을 퍼지게 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在對手腳下散布毒菱。\n讓對手替換出場的寶可夢\n陷入中毒狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lance des pics autour de l’ennemi.\nIls empoisonnent les ennemis qui entrent au combat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender legt eine Falle mit Giftdornen aus. In den\nKampf eingewechselte gegnerische Pokémon werden\nvergiftet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lanza una trampa de púas tóxicas a los pies del\nobjetivo. El veneno afecta a los Pokémon oponentes\nque entran en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa piazza una trappola di punte che\navvelenano i nemici che scendono in campo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user lays a trap of poison spikes at the feet of\nthe opposing team. The spikes will poison opposing\nPokémon that switch into battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手の　足下に　どくびしを\nしかける。　交代で　でてきた　相手の\nポケモンに　毒を　おわせる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在对手的脚下撒毒菱。\n使对手替换出场的宝可梦中毒。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lanza una trampa de púas tóxicas a los pies del\nobjetivo. El veneno afecta a los Pokémon oponentes\nque entran en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
